"class:`numpy.ndarray`, a :class:`pandas.DataFrame`, an :class:`xarray."
"Dataset` made up of 1-D :class:`xarray.DataArray` data variables, or a :"
"class:`geopandas.GeoDataFrame` containing the tabular data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/src/histogram.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.histogram.histogram:43
