msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/src/histogram.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.histogram.histogram:80
msgid ""
"Handle values that fall outside the range set by ``series``. By default, "
"these values are ignored. Valid values are:  - ``\"first\"``: only include "
"values below first bin into the first bin - ``\"last\"``: only include "
"values above the last bin into that last bin - ``\"both\"``: include values "
"into the first or last bins"
msgstr ""

